            "text": "def insertFactors (I : Window) {ε : ℝ} (hε : 0 < ε) (r : ℕ) (hr : 1 ≤ r)\n    (A : AxisSpace I ε) : List (AxisSpace I ε) → AxisSpace I ε\n  | [] => A\n  | B :: Bs => insertFactors I hε r hr (insert I hε r hr A B) Bs"
